Cat Clip Composer v0.1.20

This file has no added file-type extension and is the distributable version marker. Its filename must match the application version.

Changes since v0.1.19:
- Tuned ordinary startup progress-line pacing to 20–40 milliseconds.
- Shortened the opening and completion holds to 100–200 milliseconds.
- Reduced normal measured startup handoff to approximately three seconds.
